    "title": "SOWELA highlights its dual enrollment program for students - NewsBreak",
    "text": "KPLC TV\nwebsite\nLake Charles\nSOWELA highlights its dual enrollment program for students\nBy Anissa Carby,\n1 days agoLAKE CHARLES, La. (KPLC) - Students from across the region stepped onto SOWELA’s campus, not just for a tour, but for a glimpse into their future. “I didn’t know SOWELA offered so many things that they did. They offer cooking classes, the gaming area, and the nursing (class). I’ve never seen a nursing class like that. Y’all should definitely check out Sowela,” high school senior Lacey Benoit said.",
